@title AddRoles
 @notice Adds the on-chain roles (ADR 0036) to a running deployment: deploys Roles behind a proxy, defines the
         catalogue, gives V "admin" and SYSTEM "system", and hands the rights over. A fresh deployment does not
         need this: script/Deploy.s.sol does it.
 @dev Environment: ADMIN_ADDRESS (current admin, signs and ends up with the catalogue right), UPGRADER_ADDRESS,
      OPERATOR_ADDRESS (SYSTEM).
